# The libmnl library nft links: 1.0.5 from netfilter.org, the newest release on 2026-11-13. Its digest
# is the tarball's line in the .sha256sum file netfilter.org publishes beside it, under
# https://www.netfilter.org/pub/libmnl/. The version and the digest move together, in one pull
# request, which a reviewer checks against that file.
#
# Moved by: the PM, in a pull request that reruns `make image` and `make image-repro` and the QEMU
# test that starts a Pod, when a release is published that kube-proxy needs or an advisory is
# published for the pinned one. No bot proposes it.
LIBMNL_VERSION=1.0.5
LIBMNL_URL=https://www.netfilter.org/pub/libmnl/libmnl-1.0.5.tar.bz2
LIBMNL_SHA256=274b9b919ef3152bfb3da3a13c950dd60d6e2bcd54230ffeca298d03b40d0525
#
# Licences (SPDX), read from the COPYING or LICENSE of each source and checked by naru-release (ADR 0076).
LIBMNL_LICENSE=LGPL-2.1-or-later
